--- /dev/null
+++ b/pkgs/os-specific/linux/zfs/zfs-bump-Linux-Maximum-7.3.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+Description: bump Linux-Maximum to declare Linux 7.3 support
+ The Linux 7.3 compatibility fixes (see linux-7.3-compat.patch) are
+ present in this tree, but META still declares Linux-Maximum: 7.2, so
+ the autoconf kernel-version check refuses to build against Linux 7.3.
+ Bump the field to 7.3 to permit it.
+Forwarded: not-needed
+Signed-off-by: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
