+@@ -6,5 +6,5 @@ Release:       1
+ Release-Tags:  relext
+ License:       CDDL
+ Author:        OpenZFS
+-Linux-Maximum: 7.2
++Linux-Maximum: 7.3
+ Linux-Minimum: 4.18
