+ b539aeacf8cc "block: rename bi_bvec_done"). Add a configure probe and use
+ the right field name in the block device compat layer.
+ .
+ Rebased onto 2.4.4; no functional change from the upstream commit.
+Author: Rob Norris <robn@despairlabs.com>
+Origin: upstream, https://github.com/robn/zfs/commit/dfbff5a991761c15843352616c866dabcdbf7ffd
